<section class="section">
      <div class="container inner-page-content">
        <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> November 2, 2026</p>
        <p>Professor Jerry RV respects your privacy. This policy describes the information that may be collected when
          you visit this website, contact us, or request RV training, service, or inspection services.</p>
        <h2>Information you provide</h2>
        <p>When you contact us by email, telephone, or a website form, you may provide your name, contact information,
          RV details, service location, and information about your questions or requested services. Please avoid sending
          payment-card details or other sensitive information through ordinary email or contact forms.</p>
        <h2>Website and technical information</h2>
        <p>Like most websites, our hosting infrastructure may record technical information such as IP address, browser
          type, requested pages, dates, and diagnostic or security events. If we add analytics, advertising technology,
          or optional cookies, we will review and update this notice to describe those practices.</p>
        <h2>How information is used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to questions and schedule or provide requested services.</li>
          <li>To communicate about estimates, appointments, reports, and follow-up matters.</li>
          <li>To maintain website performance, reliability, and security.</li>
          <li>To meet applicable legal, recordkeeping, or business obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Sharing information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell customer contact information as part of our ordinary business practices. Information may be
          shared with service providers who support hosting, communications, scheduling, payment processing, or other
          business operations when needed to provide services. We may also disclose information when required by law or
          to protect legitimate rights and safety.</p>
        <h2>Inspection reports and photographs</h2>
        <p>RV service and inspection work may involve photographs, notes, and reports about an RV. We use these
          materials to perform and document the requested work and share them with the customer or others as authorized
          or required. Specific report delivery and confidentiality terms may also be addressed in a service agreement.
        </p>
        <h2>Retention and security</h2>
        <p>Information is retained as reasonably needed for business operations, service records, dispute resolution,
          and applicable legal requirements. We use reasonable safeguards, but no internet transmission or storage
          system can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>
        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>This website may link to third-party websites, including product providers and Atlas RV Solutions. Their
          privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p>
        <h2>Your questions and choices</h2>
        <p>To ask about personal information you have provided, or to request a correction or deletion where applicable,
          contact <a href="mailto:info@ProfessorJerryRV.com">info@ProfessorJerryRV.com</a>. Some information may need to
          be retained for legal or legitimate business reasons.</p>
        <h2>Updates</h2>
        <p>We may revise this policy as the website and services evolve. The effective date above identifies the current
          version.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
